    "enUS": {
      "description": "So you want some Fool's Stout, eh?  Thinking of heading back to the races...?\n\nAll right, bring me more of Zanzil's mixture and I'll make some more stout for you.",
      "dialogue": {
        "4c2a6d4b23e464f7c2f5": "So you want some Fool's Stout, eh?  Thinking of heading back to the races...?$B$BAll right, bring me more of Zanzil's mixture and I'll make some more stout for you.",
        "738aa09c9fb9f771655e": "Ah, very good! Here is your pay.$B$BAnd here is a little something extra... for your discretion.",
        "d143a17cad6cf49a8d3d": "Do you have those Zanzil mixtures yet, $N?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring 12 of Zanzil's Mixture to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay.",
      "title": "Fool's Stout",
